CHECK:UNNECESSARY_PARENTHESES: Unnecessary parentheses around 'state->fb->pitches[1] != state->fb->pitches[2]'
#141: FILE: drivers/gpu/drm/arm/malidp_planes.c:145:
+	if (ms->n_planes == 3 &&
+	    !(mp->hwdev->features & MALIDP_DEVICE_LV_HAS_3_STRIDES) &&
+	    (state->fb->pitches[1] != state->fb->pitches[2]))

Parentheses are not required in the following cases:

  1. Function pointer uses::

      (foo->bar)();

    could be::

      foo->bar();

  2. Comparisons in if::

      if ((foo->bar) && (foo->baz))
      if ((foo == bar))

    could be::

      if (foo->bar && foo->baz)
      if (foo == bar)

  3. addressof/dereference single Lvalues::

      &(foo->bar)
      *(foo->bar)

    could be::

      &foo->bar
      *foo->bar

